==Battleground==
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ms. Madonna]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Teacher A]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**4 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**8 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] cats like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] will be helpful here, but [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is a great example due to also being able to block Ms. Madonna's waves as well, and any other [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] cats will be helpful too. Stall the Teacher Bear for as long as possible at the beginning so you can get max Worker Cat and money, the Ginger Snaches and other peons are not that much of a threat, so you won't need to worry about them. The steady stream of peons during the boss wave along with the Owlbrows means that you probably won't be in dire need of money, but you can also use [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]] cats to snipe Teacher A.

